temperature sweep, subckt-instance parameter sweep, model parameter sweep
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
load "spice/diode.osdi"
model resistor resistor
model vsource vsource
model dm sp_diode is=1e-14
subckt rdiv (a b)
  parameters rr=1k
  r1 (a b) resistor r=rr
ends
v1 (a 0) vsource dc=1
x1 (a b) rdiv rr=1k
r2 (b 0) resistor r=1k
v2 (d 0) vsource dc=0.6
d1 (d 0) dm
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  sweep t1 option="temp" values=[0, 50]
    analysis opt op
  analysis opt_after op
  sweep s2 instance="x1" parameter="rr" values=[1k, 3k]
    analysis opx op
  analysis opx_after op
  sweep s3 model="dm" parameter="is" values=[1e-14, 1e-12]
    analysis opm op
  analysis opm_after op
endc
